/*
  core/masks/attentive_confirm.spthy -- f_H for the Attentive mask handling a generic DECISION (confirm).
  Handles the decision properly. Records !Did(P,did) -- a handled decision, read by the sigma9 density
  detector -- and Handled(P,did) for lemmas. Answered(did) gates one response per decision
  (answered_once). RespMask Attentive gated by mask_state (only while no degrade is active).
*/

rule Confirm_Attentive:
    [ !Decision(P, did) ]
  --[ Confirm(P, did, 'Attentive'), RespMask(P,'Attentive'), Handled(P, did), Answered(did) ]->
    [ !Did(P, did), DecisionDone(P, did) ]
